 Night-shift scenario — Chennai IT hub  
 If a heavy shower floods the usual pickup lane at 01:30, the driver follows the diversion to a verified hotel lobby as a temporary safe-drop. Operations notifies the employee and manager, and the vehicle stays with the group until all employees confirm safe entry.
 
